{"ref":"BDB, עִיִּים","hw":"עִיִּים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עִיִּים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Γαι, etc. (as if <span dir=\"rtl\">עַי</span>):<br><strong>1.</strong>  station of Isr. on E. border of Moab, before <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּיבֹן גָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:45\" href=\"/Numbers.33.45\">Nu 33:45</a>, = <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיִּי הָעֲבָרִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:44\" href=\"/Numbers.33.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:11\" href=\"/Numbers.21.11\">21:11</a> (all P; 𝔊 ignores <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֲבָרִים</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  city in Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:29\" href=\"/Joshua.15.29\">Jos 15:29</a> (P).","next":"BDB, עֵילוֹם","prev":"BDB, עֵיטָם"}